Subject: Free health & life coverage guide for Magic Leap employees affected by the Plantation layoff

Hi Magic Leap HR team,

We publish free, sourced guides for Florida workers going through a layoff. We made a page for the Magic Leap Plantation transition that explains, in plain English and Spanish:
- the 60-day window to enroll in a Marketplace health plan after job-based coverage ends, and COBRA vs Marketplace;
- that group life insurance usually ends with employment, and Florida's 31-day window to convert it (Fla. Stat. 627.566).

If coverage ends at the end of the separation month, the 31-day life window would close around 2026-12-01 and the 60-day health window around 2026-12-30; your benefits team will know the exact coverage end date.

Would you include the link (or our one-page printable) in the exit packet or benefits FAQ? There's no cost and no sales pitch to your team: people only hear from a licensed agent if they request it themselves.

Link: {LINK}
Printable: {PDF}

Thank you,
{SENDER}

